{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15212460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15212460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521246001:0":{"text":"바리, 전리품이 적지 않은 것 같군.","source_cn":"看来你的战利品不少，巴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEFAE54552AC03D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521246002:0":{"text":"당연하죠. 제 뒤에 산처럼 쌓인 짐승 시체를 좀 보세요. 누가 저보다 더 많이 잡았겠어요?","source_cn":"当然。看看我身后堆成山的野兽尸体，谁能比我更多？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E8F983E99D8D0DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521246003:0":{"text":"말할 것도 없이 오늘의 승자는 저예요!","source_cn":"不用想，今天的胜者肯定是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBF4F0356B9BD74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521246004:0":{"text":"아직 결과도 나오지 않았는데 벌써 좋아하는군.","source_cn":"结果还没宣布，你高兴得太早了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E6944BD8CC7164E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521246005:0":{"text":"다른 사람의 성과도 잘 보도록 해. 수스도 너만큼 사냥감을 잡았어. 그리고 오늘 네가 한 짓... 동료를 공격한 일 역시 네 성적에 포함될 거다.","source_cn":"也好好看看别人的成果，索斯的猎物堆得和你一样高。再想想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A4BD42FD1C5A257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521246006:1":{"text":"윽, 포함되면 어쩔 수 없죠. 이미 벌어진 일인걸요.","source_cn":"哼，你要算就算吧，算了又能怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D300A5D7234C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521246007:1":{"text":"두고 보세요. 제가 반드시 이길 거예요!","source_cn":"等着瞧吧，我肯定会赢的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AEAAE0EA01AE7EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:狩猎队长森绒":{"text":"사냥 대장 센로","source":"狩猎队长森绒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴":{"text":"바리","source":"巴","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}